      "content": "i get what you're saying about irritation but i feel like i have more control if i just treat it myself. what if i just used a bit of honey instead? i've heard honey is a miracle for skin healing and it's much gentler than oil. if i just apply a thick layer of honey and wrap it up, would that be a safe way to treat the blistered area at home while i wait for the pain to die down? it seems way safer than just leaving it open or going to a hospital.",
